; Minimal desktop startup for the isolated QEMU community preview.
FailAt 21
MakeDir RAM:T RAM:Clipboards RAM:ENV RAM:ENV/SYS
Assign T: RAM:T
Assign CLIPS: RAM:Clipboards
Assign ENV: RAM:ENV
Assign ENVARC: SYS:Prefs/Env-Archive
Assign KEYMAPS: DEVS:Keymaps
Assign FONTS: SYS:Fonts
Assign LOCALE: SYS:Locale
Assign LIBS: SYS:Classes ADD
Assign WANDERER: SYS:System/Wanderer
Assign IMAGES: SYS:System/Images DEFER
Assign THEMES: SYS:Prefs/Presets/Themes
Assign THEME: THEMES:AROSDefault
If EXISTS THEME:Images
    Assign IMAGES: THEME:Images PREPEND
EndIf
Assign HELP: LOCALE:Help DEFER
Path C: SYS:System S: QUIET
SetEnv KAFFEINE_CPU jit
PreviewSetup >SYS:KaffeinePreview/Results/setup.txt
Echo "rc $RC" >SYS:KaffeinePreview/Results/setup-rc.txt
If EXISTS C:AddUSBClasses
    Run <NIL: >NIL: QUIET AddUSBClasses
EndIf
If EXISTS C:PsdStackLoader
    PsdStackLoader >NIL:
EndIf
IPrefs
If EXISTS S:User-Startup
    Execute S:User-Startup
EndIf
WANDERER:Wanderer
If NOT ERROR
    EndCLI
EndIf
